{"speciesId":631,"names":{"fr":"Aflamanoir","es":"Heatmor","en":"Heatmor","ja":"クイタラン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il aspire de l’air par la queue et entretient un brasier dans son corps. C’est le prédateur des Fermite."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It breathes through a hole in its tail while it burns with an internal fire. Durant is its prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Avec sa langue de feu à haute température, il fait fondre le corps d’acier des Fermite pour les dévorer."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Using their very hot, flame-covered tongues, they burn through Durant’s steel bodies and consume their insides."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It draws in air through its tail, transforms it into fire, and uses it like a tongue. It melts Durant and eats them."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It draws in air through its tail, transforms it into fire, and uses it like a tongue. It melts Durant and eats them."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Avec sa langue de feu à haute température, il fait fondre le corps d’acier des Fermite pour les dévorer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Usa su lengua de fuego para derretir la armadura de acero de los Durant y llegar así hasta su interior."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Using their very hot, flame-covered tongues, they burn through Durant’s steel bodies and consume their insides."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"高温で 燃える 炎の 舌で アイアントの 鋼の 体を 溶かして 中身を いただくのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il aspire de l’air par la queue et le transforme en une langue de feu qui fait fondre les Fermite dont il se régale."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Absorbe aire por el orificio de su cola para prender una lengua de llamas con la que derrite a los Durant para comerlos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It draws in air through its tail, transforms it into fire, and uses it like a tongue. It melts Durant and eats them."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"尻尾から 取りこんだ 空気を 炎に変えて ベロのように 使い アイアントを 溶かして 食べるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Avec sa langue de feu à haute température, il fait fondre le corps d’acier des Fermite pour les dévorer."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Usa su lengua de fuego para derretir la armadura de acero de los Durant y llegar así hasta su interior."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Using their very hot, flame-covered tongues, they burn through Durant’s steel bodies and consume their insides."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"高温で 燃える 炎の 舌で アイアントの 鋼の 体を 溶かして 中身を いただくのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il aspire de l’air par la queue et le transforme en une langue de feu qui fait fondre les Fermite dont il se régale."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Absorbe aire por el orificio de su cola para prender una lengua de llamas con la que derrite a los Durant para comerlos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It draws in air through its tail, transforms it into fire, and uses it like a tongue. It melts Durant and eats them."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"尻尾から 取りこんだ 空気を 炎に変えて ベロのように 使い アイアントを 溶かして 食べるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il aspire de l’air par le bout de sa queue et produit ainsi sa fameuse langue de feu. Si on lui bouche la queue, il se sent mal."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Absorbe aire por el orificio de la cola para prender las llamas que expulsa. Si la abertura se obstruye, enferma."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"There’s a hole in its tail that allows it to draw in the air it needs to keep its fire burning. If the hole gets blocked, this Pokémon will fall ill."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"しっぽの 穴から 空気を 取りこみ 炎を 燃やす。 穴を 塞がれると 具合が 悪くなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se sert de sa flamme c